---
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2 id="audience-title">Free tools, built on better standards</h2>
    <p>
      Bare Bones SEO helps site owners, developers, and agencies spend less time managing technical SEO. Behind the free tools is an open-source effort to develop common standards for visibility, control, consistency, and minimal overhead. Settings should be easy to inspect, and the site’s actual output should match them.
    </p>
    <p>
      These tools manage SEO settings, not optimization strategy. Choose your own keywords and content approach; Bare Bones helps you put those decisions into practice. Both projects are free and open source: <a href={site.github}>WordPress plugin</a> and <a href={site.staticGithub}>AI/static-site standards</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: var(--measure); margin-inline: auto; margin-left: max(1.25rem, calc((100% - var(--wide)) / 2)); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem); }
  p { margin-top: var(--space-2); color: var(--ink-soft); }
  h2 + p { margin-top: var(--space-3); }
</style>
